  CellName: Regatta
  Description: 'Regatta course-pool entry 4, shuffle course Wild5
    (CellTypeChoiceOptions.CourseVariantWise, list order = Regatta Course Pool order - the
    host deals one enabled entry per match). A searched course: its rails prefab carries the
    whole RegattaCourseGenome (circuit, braid, features, placements), the one the real-game
    judge raced. Wide search shard_cloud4-0049: Ourobor world, super-shielded 48%, no rails,
    nucleus, lifeforms none, lap 4968 u. Field spread {''card'': 4.168, ''L5'': 6.215} (3
    seeds, real-game judge). 4570 prisms measured; PhaseThresholds ride that count at the
    rail prism''s nominal volume plus a trail band. The spawn profile is the Barren cell''s
    (no flora, no fauna). Regenerate with Tools/Build/author_regatta_assets.py from
    Tools/Build/regatta_shuffle_pool.json, never by hand.'
